    <string-array name="tx_method">
        <item>Cyclus looks at the length of your recent cycles, counting the newest ones more. It shows a range where your next period is likely to start, about 8 times out of 10.</item>
        <item>With few cycles the range is wide on purpose. It narrows as you log more.</item>
        <item>Everything is calculated on your device. Cyclus never receives your data.</item>
    </string-array>
